---
import "../../styles/support.css";
import "../../styles/waitlist-guide.css";
import ActionButton from "../landing/ui/ActionButton.astro";
import { audioBookChoicesConfig } from "../../config/site";
---

<div class="waitlist-guide">
  <section class="waitlist-guide__hero landing-surface">
    <p class="waitlist-guide__eyebrow">Support</p>
    <h1 class="waitlist-guide__title">Need help with AudioChoices? Email support directly.</h1>
    <p class="waitlist-guide__lead">
      Support is intentionally straightforward for now. Send an email, describe what went wrong,
      and include your device details if you have them.
    </p>

    <div class="waitlist-guide__actions">
      <ActionButton href={audioBookChoicesConfig.supportGmailHref}>Open Gmail in browser</ActionButton>
      <ActionButton href={audioBookChoicesConfig.supportMailtoHref} variant="secondary">
        Open your email app
      </ActionButton>
    </div>

    <p class="waitlist-guide__note">
      If those options do not open cleanly, copy the support email and draft below.
    </p>
  </section>

  <div class="waitlist-guide__grid">
    <section class="waitlist-guide__card landing-surface">
      <div class="waitlist-guide__card-head">
        <div class="waitlist-guide__detail waitlist-guide__detail--email">
          <p class="waitlist-guide__detail-label">Send it to</p>
          <p class="waitlist-guide__detail-value waitlist-guide__detail-value--email">
            {audioBookChoicesConfig.supportEmail}
          </p>
        </div>
        <button
          class="waitlist-guide__copy"
          type="button"
          data-copy-value={audioBookChoicesConfig.supportEmail}
        >
          Copy email
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="waitlist-guide__detail">
        <p class="waitlist-guide__detail-label">Suggested subject</p>
        <p class="waitlist-guide__pill">{audioBookChoicesConfig.supportDraft.subject}</p>
      </div>

      <p class="waitlist-guide__body">
        A short description is enough to start. Which book you were listening to and your device
        details help if you have them.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="waitlist-guide__card landing-surface">
      <p class="waitlist-guide__kicker">What to include</p>
      <h2 class="waitlist-guide__card-title">A useful note gets the issue grounded quickly.</h2>

      <ul class="waitlist-guide__list">
        <li>What you were trying to do.</li>
        <li>What happened instead.</li>
        <li>The book or story point, and whether you were tapping or using head-nod.</li>
        <li>Your device and OS version, if you know them.</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="waitlist-guide__body">
        AudioChoices has no account and no login, and your listening progress stays on your
        device, so there is no profile to look up. If your question is about a purchase, a
        subscription, a rating or deleting your data, include the anonymous installation
        identifier shown in the app's Settings screen &mdash; without it there is no way to find
        your records. Please avoid sending sensitive personal information or another person's
        information unless it is needed for the support request.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <section class="waitlist-guide__card landing-surface">
    <div class="waitlist-guide__card-head">
      <div>
        <p class="waitlist-guide__kicker">Ready-made draft</p>
        <h2 class="waitlist-guide__card-title">Send this as-is or edit it first.</h2>
      </div>
      <button
        class="waitlist-guide__copy"
        type="button"
        data-copy-value={audioBookChoicesConfig.supportDraft.body}
      >
        Copy draft
      </button>
    </div>

    <pre class="waitlist-guide__template">{audioBookChoicesConfig.supportDraft.body}</pre>
  </section>
</div>
